              <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Activate calculation of ray-traced reflections and transparency. Reflectance can be set by &lt;span style=" font-style:italic;"&gt;Material/Reflection. &lt;/span&gt;Transparency settings are in the same tab as reflection.&lt;br/&gt;Also enable with Monte Carlo global illumination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
